  id: fortunate
  displayName: Fortunate
  description: The Prince remembers a fight won while this was worn. Grants run-scoped
    Favor -- separate from and additional to a character's permanent earnedFavor
    -- gone the moment the current descent ends. Base 5 favour per win at Ordinary/tier-0
    is a small, steady nudge toward better drops for the rest of THIS run; it does
    not persist past it, which is the whole point of run-scoped favour (Q4 of the
    plan's locked decisions).
